<h2>SURGERY II — repeat-onset d, all six attention layers, both ends (#1505)</h2>
<p>Round I localized <b>d</b> as a whole-sequence mean at a 1024-token horizon — verbose reasoning, not the attractor. Round II changes all three inputs at once: capture at <b>cap 4096</b> (penalty-free, seed 23, train-only), take d as <b>mean(write during the loop) − mean(write before it)</b> from the detected repeat-onset, and operate on all six full-attention layers <code>{3,7,11,15,19,23}</code> (this model interleaves linear attention every 4th layer). Variant <b>B</b> cuts the <i>read</i> side instead: <code>embed_tokens</code> rows (unembed is tied) and <code>o_proj</code> rank-1, so the residual stream can no longer be expressed in logits or written by attention along d. <em>capture pending</em></p>



